2026-11-17T03:25:18.7732040Z # Public install with a malformed inherited locale validated and published a receipt-bound alternate app.
2026-11-17T03:25:18.7748510Z # A foreign listener survived the launcher refusal and no store was initialized.
2026-11-17T03:25:18.7750340Z # An occupied store without its key refused before spawn and preserved its contents.
2026-11-17T03:25:18.7753360Z # Concurrent cold attempts with malformed locales completed and a single verified gateway served both built shells after both launchers exited.
2026-11-17T03:25:18.7758700Z # Warm launch kept the serving PID and private managed logs excluded the request query.
